cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MATLAB Engineering Portfolio: structural dynamics, modal analysis, rotordynamics and numerical methods"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB / GNU Octave routines developed during a BSc in Acoustical
  Engineering (UFSM) and an MSc in Mechanical Engineering (UNICAMP):
  nonlinear Newmark time integration with Newton-Raphson iterations,
  validated against Simcenter AMESim and the Géradin & Rixen elastic
  pendulum benchmark; experimental modal analysis of an electric guitar
  (H1 FRF, CMIF, MAC); damping identification; rotordynamics with
  hydrodynamic bearings; vibration isolation; FEM time integration and
  numerical optimization.
